Parallelized integrated nested Laplace approximations for fast
Bayesian inference
Lisa Gaedke-Merzhäuser1
· Janet van Niekerk2
· Olaf Schenk1
· Håvard Rue2

in

Statistics and Computing
(2023) 33:25
https://doi.org/10.1007/s11222-022-10192-1

